    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power\u2014literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place looks like an old store on its last legs\u2026 but why is there such a vast and suspicious space hidden beneath the building? What exactly happened here?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Abandoned \u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Hunter is a single-player, first-person shooter with a twist: instead of bullets, you shoot coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters drop all kinds of coins when defeated, and those coins serve a double purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they\u2019re your ammunition and your currency. Use them wisely\u2014either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.poster.avif?t=1749608138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.webm?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.mp4?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey\u2026 sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. \ud83d\ude09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.poster.avif?t=1749608138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.webm?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.mp4?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Potion \u2013 Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Potion \u2013 Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Potion \u2013 Reveals the location of all coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champagne \u2013 Sacrifice half your HP for a short burst of double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Drink \u2013 Run faster, move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.poster.avif?t=1749608138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.webm?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.mp4?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power\u2014literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place looks like an old store on its last legs\u2026 but why is there such a vast and suspicious space hidden beneath the building? What exactly happened here?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Abandoned \u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Hunter is a single-player, first-person shooter with a twist: instead of bullets, you shoot coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters drop all kinds of coins when defeated, and those coins serve a double purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they\u2019re your ammunition and your currency. Use them wisely\u2014either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.poster.avif?t=1749608138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.webm?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.mp4?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey\u2026 sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. \ud83d\ude09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.poster.avif?t=1749608138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.webm?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.mp4?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Potion \u2013 Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Potion \u2013 Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Potion \u2013 Reveals the location of all coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champagne \u2013 Sacrifice half your HP for a short burst of double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Drink \u2013 Run faster, move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.poster.avif?t=1749608138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.webm?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.mp4?t=1749608138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
